{"id":"44b1d859aba5ef96","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-random-computable-subsequence.md","title":"可计算单射抽取保持Martin-Löf随机性","display":"thm-random-computable-subsequence — 可计算单射抽取保持Martin-Löf随机性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-random-computable-subsequence","aliases":["43-thm-random-computable-subsequence"],"display":"thm-random-computable-subsequence — 可计算单射抽取保持Martin-Löf随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-mltest]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.6 Theorem 11.6.1的本地推广，印刷262，PDF282","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-random-computable-subsequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-random-computable-subsequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random-computable-subsequence — 可计算单射抽取保持Martin-Löf随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.6 Theorem 11.6.1的本地推广，印刷262，PDF282"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\circ f\">\\(X\\circ f\\)</span> 为通常函数复合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}\">\\(\\operatorname{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\\)</span>、Martin-Löf检验及柱集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\left(\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(f(m)=f(n)\\Rightarrow m=n\\right)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X\\circ f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\left(\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(f(m)=f(n)\\Rightarrow m=n\\right)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X\\circ f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：F(X)=X∘f的每个长度k输出柱的逆像由k个互异坐标上的约束给出，故是统一可计算闭开集，公平硬币测度恰为2^{-k}。这些逆像确定F保持乘积概率测度，且有效开集的逆像统一有效开。若F(X)失败某ML检验，则X失败逐层取逆像的ML检验，矛盾。单射是必要条件：常值f会重复同一位而产生常值序列。原书仅直接陈述投影和可计算列；此节点明确标作推广。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.6 Theorem 11.6.1的本地推广，印刷262，PDF282。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$X\\circ f$ 为通常函数复合，$\\operatorname{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$、Martin-Löf检验及柱集见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-mltest]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$X\\circ f$ 为通常函数复合，$\\